	(text "Triac channel (used 3x: top element, bottom element, fan)\nMOC3052M random-phase driver; zero-cross timing comes from firmware + ZC detector.\nRg: 2x 180R 1206 pulse-rated (Panasonic ERJ-P08 / Vishay CRCW-HP) in series.\nSnubber (C + 2x 47R 1206) DNP for first test; populate if the fan channel misbehaves."
